{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e8f7e9bbe79d51a00cc397be2c7226f619ce44997c992d18b0afa582024061e8","ja":"買い物も終わり、駐車場から車を出しに行った歌織と\n合流しようとする紬だったが……","zh":"买好东西后，紬正准备去和\n从停车场去取车的歌织汇合，然而……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"abd0c2c11c9c55375ec0e0f82d7fc65ce523098ea20221c2068caa051833a972","ja":"えっと、桜守さんは……\nああ、あちらですね。","zh":"那个，樱守小姐在……\n啊，在那边呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3c85e073d34ceba9ff11ab06e0ffa9252d06b256a86803131f7aea29f4502ef2","ja":"そ、そうですね……。\nどうしたらいいのかしら……。","zh":"这、这样啊……。\n该怎么办才好呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5a49d0f55e7a918c520b09d34dcd9ec4ac2f6904b43c48c8b7e9bd3da4646910","ja":"（……！？　桜守さんが、\n何やら怪しげな人たちに絡まれて……）","zh":"（……！？　樱守小姐\n好像被什么可疑的人纠缠了……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"839281b6f93bc644f030577b83e5216776c2f89eb469aca355fa3584f6c81c90","ja":"（も、もしかしてあれはナンパ……！\nど、どうすれば！？）","zh":"（难、难道说那是在搭讪……！\n该、该怎么办才好！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f48b96869bab0518a2d8c84199ed5f4c84a82f9590dbc8becbd456f7e1dcc7e5","ja":"私も詳しくはないんですけど……。","zh":"我其实也不是很了解……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b69f898d9c959f802b6de1a29682d579687c00e1c71c2a3b7134f2eebe5f1b13","ja":"お、お姉さま！　早くこちらへ！\n父も、もうすぐ来ますから！","zh":"姐、姐姐大人！快到这边来！\n父亲他也马上就要过来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a393d18c61f3dc023e06a0d202a119dc52e6f51d8a3bd574933ba5e3f59aca1b","ja":"ええっ！？　紬ちゃん……！？","zh":"咦！？　小紬……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d702f9349163051beea8fd8446c9559aa29d0c533ce4d087e7075937499eb536","ja":"で、ですからあなた方は……お姉さまを\n連れていこうとするのは、おやめくださいまっし！","zh":"所、所以你们……\n请别再想把姐姐大人带走了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329","ja":"数分後……","zh":"过了几分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"af729203fd30a81be603f08304a245b62560267e1369b863bbea5ee2c41b086a","ja":"ああっ、うちはなんてことを……。\nまさか、道を聞かれていただけなんて……。","zh":"啊啊，我都干了些什么啊……\n没想到，对方居然只是在问路而已……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"db3bdfc9ed9bb0e04e58973611319984a936a481c5886aa825f3b73df0feebe0","ja":"そんなに落ち込まないで。\nあの人たちも全然気にしてなかったし……ね？","zh":"别那么沮丧嘛。\n那些人也完全没放在心上……好吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"43d20f1318ef6d4321f381cae2b2a628d99b1d14aff97f3d09ebdb6930cd2ac0","ja":"それに私、紬ちゃんに助けてもらえて\nすごく嬉しかったのよ？","zh":"而且小紬能来帮我，\n我真的很高兴哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"1ee3112a188bd37047fb2e6359d1aa188f872fcaa234fc9060715b94ef098182","ja":"紬ちゃんみたいに優しくてかわいい妹が\n本当にいたら、きっと幸せでしょうね♪","zh":"要是真的能有像小紬那样温柔又可爱的妹妹，\n一定会很幸福吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"26c5910c6c2e307e0fe0a0390d1afa0946b245c87517ca541220e9c785de90d3","ja":"そんな……桜守さんこそ、お優しくて凛とされていて、\n理想のお姉さまだと思います！","zh":"怎么会……樱守小姐才是既温柔又端庄凛然，\n我觉得您就是理想中的大姐姐！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"f4776e4165fbfd759fa21f0d4651135cc83132a2f0e5d5e4beb6edf24288b325","ja":"ふふっ、ありがとう。かわいい妹とドライブって\n思ったら、帰りはもっと運転に力が入っちゃいそう♪","zh":"呵呵，谢谢。一想到是\n跟可爱的妹妹去兜风，回去时开车感觉会更起劲呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1244.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"00ec9e0cc4773e04d9397144c1a822f4daee8cb769aeff9f32e17e13535ef8f6","ja":"そうですか……えっ！？　あ、あの、それは……。\n帰りはお手柔らかにお願いしたく……！","zh":"这样啊……诶！？啊、那个，这可就……。\n回去的时候还请手下留情……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
